This goes against your approved preference for flexibility and your recent choices to keep more cash on hand. Your emergency fund is at 2.2 months against a target of ₱210,000.00, and you approved a 3-month target. You also chose the bigger buffer in Session 1 and the split approach in Session 2 because you wanted cash on hand.

